---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy - MrCompress"
	description="Read our privacy policy. MrCompress processes all images locally in your browser. We never upload or store your images on our servers."
>
	<section class="py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-sm text-body dark:prose-invert">
				<p class="mb-4">
					Your privacy is our absolute priority. MrCompress is designed to process all your images locally on your computer.
				</p>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">No Data Collection</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					We do not collect, store, or transmit any of your image data. All processing is performed within your web browser. No image is ever uploaded to our servers.
				</p>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Local Storage</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					We may use local storage to remember your preferences (like your theme choice), but this information never leaves your device.
				</p>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Analytics</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					We use privacy-friendly Plausible Analytics to understand website traffic. It does not use cookies and does not track personal data.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
